OL,3,ARow in Michigan over Democrat's shock
OL,4,Aendorsement of Republican as US midterm
OL,5,Acampaigns enter last day
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump's Republican party currently
OL,8,Fcontrols both chambers of Congress -
OL,9,Fthe Senate and the House of
OL,10,FRepresentatives. Democrats are hoping
OL,11,Fto flip enough seats to win a majority
OL,13,FThe elections - called midterms as they
OL,14,Ffall in middle of a president's
OL,15,Ffour-year term - are often seen as an
OL,16,Fappraisal of the current president
OL,18,FWhat's up for grabs? All 435 seats in
OL,19,Fthe House; 35 of the 100 seats in the
OL,20,FSenate; and some state-level
OL,21,Fpoliticians, including governors - read
OL,22,Four basic guide
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
